 Usage: verify_artifacts.py merge [OPTIONS]                                     
                                                                                
 Merge a LoRA adapter with its base model into a full model.                    
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ *  --adapter            -a                       <str>  Path to the LoRA     │
│                                                         adapter directory    │
│                                                         [required]           │
│    --backend                                     <str>  Merge backend:       │
│                                                         transformers or mlx  │
│                                                         [default:            │
│                                                         transformers]        │
│    --dequantize                                         Explicitly           │
│                                                         dequantize an MLX    │
│                                                         base for dense fused │
│                                                         output               │
│    --base               -b                       <str>  Base model ID.       │
│                                                         Auto-detected from   │
│                                                         adapter_config.json  │
│                                                         if not set.          │
│    --output             -o                       <str>  Output directory for │
│                                                         the merged model     │
│                                                         [default: ./merged]  │
│    --dtype                                       <str>  Data type for the    │
│                                                         merged model:        │
│                                                         float16, bfloat16,   │
│                                                         float32              │
│                                                         [default: float16]   │
│    --trust-remote-code                                  Allow loading models │
│                                                         that ship custom     │
│                                                         Python via auto_map. │
│                                                         Default deny         │
│                                                         (v0.36.0). Only      │
│                                                         enable if you trust  │
│                                                         the source.          │
│    --save-format                                 <str>  Merged-checkpoint    │
│                                                         save format. fp16    │
│                                                         (default) writes a   │
│                                                         standard fp16 merge. │
│                                                         4bit / 4bit_forced   │
│                                                         write a single       │
│                                                         BNB-4bit-quantized   │
│                                                         merge without the    │
│                                                         dequant-merge-requa… │
│                                                         cycle (v0.53.1       │
│                                                         #142).               │
│                                                         [default: fp16]      │
│    --double-quant           --no-double-quant           BNB                  │
│                                                         double-quantization  │
│                                                         for the 4bit /       │
│                                                         4bit_forced save     │
│                                                         formats (#321).      │
│                                                         Default on, matching │
│                                                         the training         │
│                                                         loaders; pass        │
│                                                         --no-double-quant to │
│                                                         disable. Ignored for │
│                                                         the fp16 save        │
│                                                         format.              │
│                                                         [default:            │
│                                                         double-quant]        │
│    --low-memory                                         Merge tensor by      │
│                                                         tensor straight from │
│                                                         the base safetensors │
│                                                         files instead of     │
│                                                         loading the whole    │
│                                                         model into RAM.      │
│                                                         Needs the fp16 save  │
│                                                         format and a plain   │
│                                                         LoRA adapter.        │
│    --hub                                         <str>  Source hub for the   │
│                                                         base model: hf       │
│                                                         (default) /          │
│                                                         modelscope /         │
│                                                         modelers. Non-HF     │
│                                                         hubs require the     │
│                                                         matching SDK         │
│                                                         (v0.53.10 #152).     │
│                                                         [default: hf]        │
│    --help                                               Show this message    │
│                                                         and exit.            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

